    13	- `AGENTS.md` = behavioral rules, decision quality, reversibility, blast radius, proof
    14	- `README.md` = human-facing repo/product overview
    15	- `ROADMAP.md` = LEGACY pointer ledger, frozen since the `ROADMAP_SOURCE=releases` flip — the RELEASES DB (`releases.db` via `releases.sql`) is the source of truth; write via `releases roadmap add`, never by editing this file
