    18	- `HARNESS-MODELS-REGISTRY.md` = evaluated agent harnesses, supported model grades (A/B/C), and CLI flags
    19	- `MACHINE-CONTRACTS.md` = the Jog ↔ Preflight ↔ Marathon machine-contract reference (`marathon-invocation@1`, `marathon-drive/result@1`) and their version/deprecation policy
    20	- `PROJECT/**` docs = canonical execution detail for a specific effort
    21	- `PARKED/` = root holding area for incidental agent findings outside the current task; triage may promote an item into issue-first PDDA intake
    22	- `PROJECT/PDDA.md` = shared PDDA document contract maintained in Forge (incl. CHANGELOG); repo-specific adoption policy stays in this router
    23	- `PROJECT/CONSTITUTION.md` = locally maintained PDDA-layer policy of record, with verified-success, reversibility and local-first safeguards adopted by XYZ; advisory-only LLM checking is PDDA-specific and does not replace XYZ relay approval
